  "$lots": "Which classes a lot of each size gets, with weights. `terrace`: the narrow lots of a main town's terrace rows and semi-detached pairs (web/src/game/macro.ts); a class with `row` is cut to a lot only a metre wider than the house, with no driveway (housegen.ts `fitLot`).",
