  "$gardens": "A lot cut to fit its house, by garden size (a town's world says which its houses get): the garden behind the house as a share of the house's depth (`back`, a range; at least `backMin` and at most `backMax` m), beside it (`side`, m, a range) and at least `drive` m on the driveway's side (away from the front door). The front yard is `margins.front`.",
