  "windows": { "spacing": [2, 3], "daylight": 0.5 },

  "stairs": "stairs",

  "$basement": "A share of houses (`chance` per lot size) get a basement under them: stairs down from the living room, the entrance hall or the dining room, along a side wall, a hall at their foot and `count` rooms off it of the kinds in `rooms` (by `weight`; none the house has already; fewer if they don't fit). Basements have no windows: their rooms get ceiling lights enough (`lights` below). `label` names a room in the house's description.",
  "basement": {
